# Line endings are part of this repo's contract, not a preference.
#
# test/readme.test.mjs asserts the README's console blocks equal the CLI's real stdout line
# for line. On a clone made with core.autocrlf=true that comparison fails for a reason that
# has nothing to do with the change under review. Checking these in is what makes a byte
# comparison mean the same thing on every machine.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.mjs   text eol=lf
